  "question": "$$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to0}\\left(\\frac1{x\\int_0^xe^{t^2}\\,dt}-\\frac1{\\sin^2x}\\right)=\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_$$",
  "options": {},
  "correct_option": "",
  "standard_answer": "$-\\frac23$",
  "source": "import_lilei8_v3",
  "_original_answer": "",
  "solution_steps": [
    "首先将原式通分：$\\frac{\\sin^2x - x\\int_0^xe^{t^2}dt}{x\\int_0^xe^{t^2}dt \\cdot \\sin^2x}$",
    "利用泰勒展开：$\\int_0^xe^{t^2}dt = x + \\frac{x^3}{3} + o(x^3)$，$\\sin x = x - \\frac{x^3}{6} + o(x^3)$",
    "分子：$\\sin^2x - x\\int_0^xe^{t^2}dt = -\\frac{2x^4}{3} + o(x^4)$",
    "分母：$x\\int_0^xe^{t^2}dt \\cdot \\sin^2x = x^4 + o(x^4)$",
    "极限值为：$\\lim_{x\\to0} \\frac{-\\frac{2x^4}{3}}{x^4} = -\\frac{2}{3}$"
  ],
  "raw_question_text": "$$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to0}\\left(\\frac1{x\\int_0^xe^{t^2}\\,dt}-\\frac1{\\sin^2x}\\right)=\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_$$",
  "raw_answer_text": "$-\\frac23$"
